# Canonicalize bare (non-trailing-slash) paths to their trailing-slash form.
# Hugo always publishes directory-style URLs (uglyURLs = false), so the bare
# form never has real content behind it -- but a stale index entry, an old
# inbound link, or a typo'd href can still surface it and split ranking
# signals from the real page. /rhythm-builder was confirmed split this way
# (indexed separately from /rhythm-builder/ with an undeclared canonical).
